        "text_XnF3xB": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4><strong>Join the Fan Council and help shape the club’s image and culture from day one.</strong></h4><p>This club is being built for New Jersey, and the people who will fill the stands should have a hand in shaping it. The Fan Council brings community members together with club leadership to help decide how this club looks, sounds, and feels, from the matchday experience to traditions to how we show up in the community.</p><p><strong>What the council will do:</strong></p><ul><li>Give input on the matchday experience, from gameday atmosphere to fan amenities<br/></li><li>Help shape the club's traditions and culture<br/></li><li>Help grow the club by promoting it in their respective communities<br/></li><li>Be a sounding board for community engagement and local partnerships<br/></li><li>Get early looks at club news and announcements<br/></li></ul><p><strong>Benefits for participating:</strong></p><ul><li>Early access to kit launch<br/></li><li>Exclusive matchday access and experiences<br/></li><li>Year-round merchandise discount<br/></li><li>First opportunity to be amongst to select season ticket seat location<br/></li><li>Friends and family ticket discount<br/></li></ul><p><strong>Who can apply:&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Anyone who loves the beautiful game and wants to help build something lasting for New Jersey. We want a council that reflects the full range of communities across Middlesex County and beyond.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>What to expect:</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Monthly meeting with direct access to club leadership, including President Brady O'Connor. One to two hours per week helping promote the club.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>How to apply:&nbsp;</strong>Complete the short application via the link below.&nbsp;</p><p>Got Questions? Email us at <a href=\"mailto:info@hometownsoccer.com\" target=\"_blank\">info@hometownsoccer.com.</a>&nbsp;</p>",
